    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2879217b4e481125a33d2669",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是船桥产的梨汁哦！　我们两个人决定了绝对\n要用这个。为了『敬船桥一杯』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f4efe18cd37e5077407e667061019a4047077071f2fe9d0f128d85d4889645",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b15423a3eb88448f6ef808",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真真真的是吗！？　太……咳咳！\n嘛，既然以会长为目标，不被仰慕可不行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f94f2718d70c7cf3ed264ff783296275f282cbfa26d36fdc2ed5a3372fc16c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f05e1d48de1cc1429b73d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把被褥换成和会长一样的了！　一想到会长也\n盖着一样的被子，我就能安然入睡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbbad1807321fef5af3602a025b92e9d6152454868bd0ac7ecd07d54a8cd5afa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bee3c872c96462b72b5d15da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是想要奔跑的心情！　唯独这件事，\n我一直、一——直在心里想着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6815fd57904d057b669747632269c187cd3d33f911f0604ab0f1d53bd5d6f5a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdda70342a698e8a48f3b399",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如您所见！　完全没问题咳、咳咳！\n刚、刚才只是，不小心用力过猛了，咳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f41dd7869d3d079c93e0f94c900ce3cd8050cd6b946071b0ab1697a7e338f28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98a492ea0f71cfc697b2ee0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊——等等！　那明明是我想要\n说的！？　本来该是由我来帅气地收尾的——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac463095322ff76ab98fc8d53149446d1a0853bbffd579366dc562bc311dba9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c127a82f7f4b4150291e6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是想要奔跑的心情！　唯独这件事，\n我一直、一——直在心里想着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6815fd57904d057b669747632269c187cd3d33f911f0604ab0f1d53bd5d6f5a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6807d4d5806e45973f559346",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "涡轮全开！轰隆隆地拼命往前冲！\\n然后突破极限！砰！穿过终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90f98fcae5fc9fcc59c5f7a08efdc110fa5a385a0dedf83b2cc5d545d6bc5253",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e27ca665525960c0a9b0d5a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如您所见！　完全没问题咳、咳咳！\n刚、刚才只是，不小心用力过猛了，咳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f41dd7869d3d079c93e0f94c900ce3cd8050cd6b946071b0ab1697a7e338f28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1320"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:691770be05204ab282c438f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊——等等！　那明明是我想要\n说的！？　本来该是由我来帅气地收尾的——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac463095322ff76ab98fc8d53149446d1a0853bbffd579366dc562bc311dba9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
