    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7350ce3c6d75c5385404ca0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好勒，来了！　……嗯嗯，正是——\n『云外苍天』。这个，请务必写上去哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1cf0691ae15fbc0bfc2cf8abf4152b2a3efd2d3278dfb951a6ab721c7c3778",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2fcf153cb40307987fe369",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志是，『很强』的。\n给所有这样相信着我的人！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b50f4ed31f9b42fd6f8d15b3c709f4578f65b74aeaf8e7aeeb06a182a34f6d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1323"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbddbb1872fda6c9261109b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好勒，来了！　……嗯嗯，正是——\n『云外苍天』。这个，请务必写上去哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1cf0691ae15fbc0bfc2cf8abf4152b2a3efd2d3278dfb951a6ab721c7c3778",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
