        "232",
        "1325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370653e94fe24f201bacd181",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是愚蠢至极。\n无论何时，一切，尽在我的掌握之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "675a72bcd470de1e8ab09272618066fbf1aa336b95192dd4b55daee8d3edb6c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08d6cb97d679d7625ec06160",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯……倒也算愉快。\n——为我的霸道，增色不少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff338bfd8c704ab2cb8e8fa974904c3dbdc5b2402bf1d6532fa5b40dd0155023",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cffdcf5853f39205cfec83f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去问姐姐大人。大多时候，我们都是一起吃饭的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2a2e151ead7e9b8f08635b6e472e935045cd33a7a434be6dc0b889fdaf2d657",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a621186e958a99ca485abbd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "（兴致高昂的黄金巨匠小姐，\n跑离了优胜者展台前）",
      "source_fingerprint": "409605a33520f4508c5cb99bf3cd0f7e06ca1ba7fac1e07c63b2fc93b1e9999a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:289f9ec66574e91f6af7bbeb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我期许自己一定要去响应那些期待的声音。\\n所以请大家要继续关注我今后的表现♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08310e1a33edb4c0f4c66b9b4261ca5f3b6924dd4cdb407e142c61311efacfcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30062a6c882ee787a1885829",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "值得称赞的态度。必须用王者的奔跑，\n来引导他们才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81308f97ad3e70037554d7d5d2d07873258a5e543dc88466dfbaf5735a59922a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abfc34c328f8e33b11f97439",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去问姐姐大人。大多时候，我们都是一起吃饭的。",
