    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a16b802f9954dcda3659d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的训练员！　这是我的规矩！\n记者小姐你没看到吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6735460de555b8b0ccc930c7268f7aae9fc20123e1e390ff20e1b100e34b39e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6401ee5c9c55a6d76737ea5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "早上沙拉的新鲜度吧\n因为『美好的一天从美好的沙拉开始』嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d848d9bcc282227bc5f3dd5926e2f675dc6e2bfce954ab04f28f1156ed644577",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:212837df7518ae7830aa7e2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为有里见家的各位为我声援……\\n所以我希望自己能带回优异的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9cdf74040d11c97fe0612742c64477d2cccebde56035aeb955f9022d807c562",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:792b761fe27ab7eb00f03920",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给最喜欢的妈妈！\n告诉她『英里果然是最强的哦！』♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d7849b051a4267d4b623ac5b18dd3913aec945977c63ff7b04a5c8c610ec062",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a7c64078e80d5ec65e073e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，记者小姐你看到了吗？　欸嘿嘿♪\n喜悦溢出了5英里那么多，一时没忍住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e400f55f942fc4cbf14c4910deefeef7a398324eecd610f26c76b5068bdfa3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c49d15fafc04eed987c17db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎？　嗯……果然还是因为英里最强，\n而我是英里最强！　的原因吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a70b8ff4fac8a43a4702096587b78b6792988fc8bbcf3232a8e8f45a00cd6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1342"
      ]
    },
